nter next!<br></li><li><strong>Playtime </strong>\u2013 Up to 12 hours of gameplay across 4 different difficulty levels!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1646390/extras/6923a4d68446d7afdbd1cc910ffb8ad2.webp?t=1730138121\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1646390/extras/2957cfedce3985fbde788c15c24e48df.avif?t=1730138121\" /></div><br>We are a small Indie studio of 2 people working for 2.5 years on this incredible journey of creating Spheriums. We hope you like it, and don't hesitate to join us on Discord!<br><br>JP &amp; Nick",
